# Compiled probes. The SOURCES are checked in, the binaries are not.
# Prebuilt binaries used to be versioned here, and a stale one made the gate
# check output strings that no longer existed in any source -- it passed
# against text nothing produced any more. Every consumer builds them now.
/probe/bin/
# Probe run output (traces, straces, logs).
/probe/traces/
/probe/__pycache__/
/probe/**/__pycache__/

